Final output schema: {"$defs": {"HedgePlanV2": {"additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"objective": {"title": "Objective", "type": "string"}, "target_hedge_ratio": {"title": "Target Hedge Ratio", "type": "string"}, "main_position_id": {"title": "Main Position Id", "type": "string"}, "hedge_position_id": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Hedge Position Id"}, "ratio_basis": {"const": "absolute_mark_notional", "title": "Ratio Basis", "type": "string"}, "expected_effect_on_exposure": {"title": "Expected Effect On Exposure", "type": "string"}, "costs": {"items": {"type": "string"}, "minItems": 1, "title": "Costs", "type": "array"}, "unlock_condition": {"title": "Unlock Condition", "type": "string"}, "failure_condition": {"title": "Failure Condition", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["objective", "target_hedge_ratio", "main_position_id", "hedge_position_id", "ratio_basis", "expected_effect_on_exposure", "costs", "unlock_condition", "failure_condition"], "title": "HedgePlanV2", "type": "object"}, "ManagementEvidence": {"additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"observations": {"items": {"type": "string"}, "minItems": 1, "title": "Observations", "type": "array"}, "evidence_for": {"items": {"type": "string"}, "minItems": 1, "title": "Evidence For", "type": "array"}, "evidence_against": {"items": {"type": "string"}, "minItems": 1, "title": "Evidence Against", "type": "array"}}, "required": ["observations", "evidence_for", "evidence_against"], "title": "ManagementEvidence", "type": "object"}, "ManagementExecution": {"additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"orders": {"items": {}, "maxItems": 0, "title": "Orders", "type": "array"}, "cancel_order_ids": {"items": {}, "maxItems": 0, "title": "Cancel Order Ids", "type": "array"}, "replace_orders": {"items": {}, "maxItems": 0, "title": "Replace Orders", "type": "array"}}, "required": ["orders", "cancel_order_ids", "replace_orders"], "title": "ManagementExecution", "type": "object"}, "ManagementRisk": {"additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"exposure_before": {"items": {"type": "string"}, "minItems": 1, "title": "Exposure Before", "type": "array"}, "exposure_after": {"items": {"type": "string"}, "minItems": 1, "title": "Exposure After", "type": "array"}, "protection_status": {"enum": ["adequate", "inadequate", "unknown", "not_applicable"], "title": "Protection Status", "type": "string"}, "costs_considered": {"items": {"type": "string"}, "minItems": 1, "title": "Costs Considered", "type": "array"}, "uncertainty": {"enum": ["high", "medium", "low"], "title": "Uncertainty", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["exposure_before", "exposure_after", "protection_status", "costs_considered", "uncertainty"], "title": "ManagementRisk", "type": "object"}, "MarketAnalysisRequestV1": {"additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"schema": {"const": "brooks.market-analysis-request.v1", "title": "Schema", "type": "string"}, "request_id": {"title": "Request Id", "type": "string"}, "symbol": {"title": "Symbol", "type": "string"}, "decision_time_ms": {"minimum": 0, "title": "Decision Time Ms", "type": "integer"}, "timeframes": {"items": {"type": "string"}, "minItems": 1, "title": "Timeframes", "type": "array"}, "market_fields": {"items": {"enum": ["ordered_ohlc", "bar_by_bar", "decision_time"], "type": "string"}, "minItems": 1, "title": "Market Fields", "type": "array"}}, "required": ["schema", "request_id", "symbol", "decision_time_ms", "timeframes", "market_fields"], "title": "MarketAnalysisRequestV1", "type": "object"}}, "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"schema": {"const": "brooks.management-decision.v2", "title": "Schema", "type": "string"}, "role": {"const": "POSITION_MANAGER", "title": "Role", "type": "string"}, "decision_time_ms": {"minimum": 0, "title": "Decision Time Ms", "type": "integer"}, "action": {"enum": ["HOLD", "REDUCE", "CLOSE", "HEDGE", "INCREASE_HEDGE", "REDUCE_HEDGE", "REMOVE_HEDGE", "REQUEST_MARKET_ANALYSIS", "RECONCILE_STATE", "MANAGEMENT_BLOCKED"], "title": "Action", "type": "string"}, "position_ids": {"items": {"type": "string"}, "title": "Position Ids", "type": "array"}, "reason": {"title": "Reason", "type": "string"}, "evidence": {"$ref": "#/$defs/ManagementEvidence"}, "risk": {"$ref": "#/$defs/ManagementRisk"}, "execution": {"$ref": "#/$defs/ManagementExecution"}, "hedge_plan": {"anyOf": [{"$ref": "#/$defs/HedgePlanV2"}, {"type": "null"}]}, "market_analysis_request": {"anyOf": [{"$ref": "#/$defs/MarketAnalysisRequestV1"}, {"type": "null"}]}, "conditions_that_change_action": {"items": {"type": "string"}, "minItems": 1, "title": "Conditions That Change Action", "type": "array"}, "reduce_fraction": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Reduce Fraction"}, "shadow_mode": {"default": false, "title": "Shadow Mode", "type": "boolean"}}, "required": ["schema", "role", "decision_time_ms", "action", "position_ids", "reason", "evidence", "risk", "execution", "hedge_plan", "market_analysis_request", "conditions_that_change_action"], "title": "ManagementDecisionV2", "type": "object"}
Input: {"correlation_id": "ETH-USDT-1h-1790002799999", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "decision_time_ms": 1790087400000, "account": {"equity": "9998.356762033562", "available_margin": "9911.2094980335616", "currency": "USDT", "position_mode": "HEDGE", "as_of_ms": 1790087400000}, "position": {"position_id": "wf-main-1", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "side": "LONG", "quantity": "0.159", "mark_price": "2740.48", "ownership_role": "MAIN", "as_of_ms": 1790087400000, "entry_price": "2749.714944", "unrealized_pnl": "-1.468356096"}, "positions": [{"position_id": "wf-main-1", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "side": "LONG", "quantity": "0.159", "mark_price": "2740.48", "ownership_role": "MAIN", "as_of_ms": 1790087400000, "entry_price": "2749.714944", "unrealized_pnl": "-1.468356096"}], "executor_state": {"as_of_ms": 1790087400000, "controller_id": "brooks-walkforward-10d", "fills_read_status": "available", "executors": [{"executor_id": "wf-exec-1", "status": "RUNNING", "trading_pair": "ETH-USDT", "controller_id": "brooks-walkforward-10d", "position_id": "wf-main-1", "config": {"stop_price": "2718.090000000000000000000000", "target_price": "2812.139999999999999999999999"}}]}, "open_orders": [], "recent_fills": [{"fill_id": "wf-fill-1", "order_id": "wf-fill-1", "position_id": "wf-main-1", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "side": "LONG", "status": "FILLED", "quantity": "0.159", "price": "2749.714944", "fee": "0.1748818704384", "filled_at_ms": 1790005679999}], "fills_since_last_event": [], "original_trade_intent": {"schema": "brooks.trade-intent.v2", "role": "TRADER", "decision": "ENTER_LONG", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "decision_time_ms": 1790002799999, "market_context": {"regime": "bull-trend", "phase": "breakout-spike with a tight range at the highs", "location": "price holds above the twice-tested H4 2700 zone (H4 bar 108 high 2700, H4 bar 118 high 2700) inside a 21-bar M15 tight range (bar 98 low 2702.56 to bar 119 high 2747.76); first opposing level 2771 (D1 bar-89 spike high), then 2850 (M15 bar 98 / H4 bar 120 high)", "always_in": "long", "notes": "H4 context (current, decision_time_ms 1789991999999) and D1 context (current, decision_time_ms 1789948799999) both read bull-trend/breakout-spike; D1 context is used only for the 2771 spike-high location, and raw closed M15/H1 bars are the entry evidence."}, "setup": {"type": "breakout pullback: buy the breakout of the 21-bar M15 tight range that has held above the broken 2700 H4 double top", "trigger_status": "pending", "signal_quality": "weak", "location_assessment": "neutral", "no_trade_reason": null}, "decision_timeframe": "M15", "context_timeframes_used": ["H1", "M15", "H4", "D1"], "entry_mechanism": "breakout_pullback", "trigger": {"reference": "M15 bar 119 high (range high)", "price_field": "high", "price": "2747.76", "source": {"timeframe": "M15", "bar_index": 119, "open_time_ms": 1790001900000, "close_time_ms": 1790002799999}, "kind": "stop", "direction": "above"}, "invalidation": {"reference": "M15 bar 117 low (low of the recent higher-low cluster 2718.09/2720.15/2718.23; back into the middle of the tight range)", "price_field": "low", "price": "2718.09", "source": {"timeframe": "M15", "bar_index": 117, "open_time_ms": 1790000100000, "close_time_ms": 1790000999999}}, "evidence_for": ["M15 bar 119 (open 2733.06, close 2734.92) is the highest close of the 21-bar consolidation and takes out the prior range highs: 2739.54 (bar 112), 2741.55 (bar 115), 2742.56 (bar 118), then 2747.76 (bar 119) - range highs are rising into the close.", "The M15 range since the spike bar 98 (open 2708.33, high 2850, low 2702.56, close 2739.13) has held entirely above 2702.56, i.e. above the H4 2700 zone that had been tagged twice (H4 bar 108 high 2700, H4 bar 118 high 2700) - a tight consolidation above a broken double top, not a pullback below it.", "H1 follow-through per the H4 transition condition: H1 bars 117-119 (open_time 1789992000000 / 1789995600000 / 1789999200000) closed 2734.09, 2734.13, 2734.92, all above the H4 breakout bar's close 2723.15, with lows 2719.08 / 2720.15 / 2718.09 above 2700.", "H1 bar 119 (open 2734.63, high 2747.76, low 2718.09, close 2734.92) makes a higher high versus H1 bar 118 high 2741.55 and closes at the top of the last five H1 bars (lows 2709.56, 2713.04, 2719.08, 2720.15, 2718.09 all hold above 2700).", "M15 lows have stopped falling under the range: 2718.23 (bar 116), 2718.09 (bar 117), 2731.83 (bar 118), 2731.83 (bar 119), so a stop below 2718.09 is a defensible structural invalidation with a defined 29.67-point risk from the 2747.76 trigger."], "evidence_against": ["M15 bar 98 printed 2850 and closed 2739.13, a 147.44-point bar with a 110.87-point upper tail; the whole 21-bar range sits inside that tail, so the buy trigger 2747.76 is still 102.24 below a level that was just rejected.", "H4 bar 120 (open 2658.81, high 2850, low 2658.06, close 2723.15) left a 126.85-point upper tail with no follow-through bar in the window; the H4 context flags two earlier upside spikes (bar 61 high 2680, bar 81 high 2609.02) that were fully retraced.", "Overhead structure crowds the setup versus its invalidation: 2747.76 is only 5.20 above the prior M15 range high 2742.56 and only 23.24 below the 2771 D1 spike high, against a 29.67-point stop distance.", "Bar 119 is a weak breakout bar, not a bull trend bar closing on its high: its close 2734.92 sits in the lower ~19% of its 2731.83-2747.76 range with a 12.84 upper tail.", "The 21-bar M15 range is only about 45 points (1.6%) and oscillates around the H4 breakout bar's close 2723.15 - consistent with balance at the breakout level, and tight-range breakouts frequently fail without a strong breakout bar."], "qualitative_confidence": "medium", "uncertainty": ["Whether the M15 tight range resolves upward or becomes a final flag: no bar in the supplied packet closes above 2747.76, so the breakout is untriggered and unconfirmed.", "The would-be signal bar is already printed (bar 119) and is marginal (new high by 5.20 with a 12.84 upper tail); a stronger bull bar closing on its high would raise confidence in the same trigger.", "The D1 context is 15 hours older than the frozen decision time and its 2771/2557 levels are contextual descriptions; the D1 spike high 2771 was exceeded only by a wick (M15 bar 98 high 2850) with no close above it."], "conditions_that_change_market_read": ["A M15 close back below 2731.83 (bar 119 low) and then below 2718.09 (bar 117 low) would mark a failed breakout of the range high and void the long case.", "A M15/H1 close below 2702.56 (bar 98 low) would break the three-hour acceptance above the H4 2700 zone and return price to the prior H4 wide range.", "Repeated M15 closes between 2718.09 and 2747.76 without exceeding 2747.76 would keep the tight-range read and argue against a breakout.", "A M15 close above 2747.76 with the low holding above 2731.83 would confirm the breakout and shift the focus to 2771 and then 2850."]}, "latest_trader_intent": {"schema": "brooks.trade-intent.v2", "role": "TRADER", "decision": "ENTER_LONG", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "decision_time_ms": 1790002799999, "market_context": {"regime": "bull-trend", "phase": "breakout-spike with a tight range at the highs", "location": "price holds above the twice-tested H4 2700 zone (H4 bar 108 high 2700, H4 bar 118 high 2700) inside a 21-bar M15 tight range (bar 98 low 2702.56 to bar 119 high 2747.76); first opposing level 2771 (D1 bar-89 spike high), then 2850 (M15 bar 98 / H4 bar 120 high)", "always_in": "long", "notes": "H4 context (current, decision_time_ms 1789991999999) and D1 context (current, decision_time_ms 1789948799999) both read bull-trend/breakout-spike; D1 context is used only for the 2771 spike-high location, and raw closed M15/H1 bars are the entry evidence."}, "setup": {"type": "breakout pullback: buy the breakout of the 21-bar M15 tight range that has held above the broken 2700 H4 double top", "trigger_status": "pending", "signal_quality": "weak", "location_assessment": "neutral", "no_trade_reason": null}, "decision_timeframe": "M15", "context_timeframes_used": ["H1", "M15", "H4", "D1"], "entry_mechanism": "breakout_pullback", "trigger": {"reference": "M15 bar 119 high (range high)", "price_field": "high", "price": "2747.76", "source": {"timeframe": "M15", "bar_index": 119, "open_time_ms": 1790001900000, "close_time_ms": 1790002799999}, "kind": "stop", "direction": "above"}, "invalidation": {"reference": "M15 bar 117 low (low of the recent higher-low cluster 2718.09/2720.15/2718.23; back into the middle of the tight range)", "price_field": "low", "price": "2718.09", "source": {"timeframe": "M15", "bar_index": 117, "open_time_ms": 1790000100000, "close_time_ms": 1790000999999}}, "evidence_for": ["M15 bar 119 (open 2733.06, close 2734.92) is the highest close of the 21-bar consolidation and takes out the prior range highs: 2739.54 (bar 112), 2741.55 (bar 115), 2742.56 (bar 118), then 2747.76 (bar 119) - range highs are rising into the close.", "The M15 range since the spike bar 98 (open 2708.33, high 2850, low 2702.56, close 2739.13) has held entirely above 2702.56, i.e. above the H4 2700 zone that had been tagged twice (H4 bar 108 high 2700, H4 bar 118 high 2700) - a tight consolidation above a broken double top, not a pullback below it.", "H1 follow-through per the H4 transition condition: H1 bars 117-119 (open_time 1789992000000 / 1789995600000 / 1789999200000) closed 2734.09, 2734.13, 2734.92, all above the H4 breakout bar's close 2723.15, with lows 2719.08 / 2720.15 / 2718.09 above 2700.", "H1 bar 119 (open 2734.63, high 2747.76, low 2718.09, close 2734.92) makes a higher high versus H1 bar 118 high 2741.55 and closes at the top of the last five H1 bars (lows 2709.56, 2713.04, 2719.08, 2720.15, 2718.09 all hold above 2700).", "M15 lows have stopped falling under the range: 2718.23 (bar 116), 2718.09 (bar 117), 2731.83 (bar 118), 2731.83 (bar 119), so a stop below 2718.09 is a defensible structural invalidation with a defined 29.67-point risk from the 2747.76 trigger."], "evidence_against": ["M15 bar 98 printed 2850 and closed 2739.13, a 147.44-point bar with a 110.87-point upper tail; the whole 21-bar range sits inside that tail, so the buy trigger 2747.76 is still 102.24 below a level that was just rejected.", "H4 bar 120 (open 2658.81, high 2850, low 2658.06, close 2723.15) left a 126.85-point upper tail with no follow-through bar in the window; the H4 context flags two earlier upside spikes (bar 61 high 2680, bar 81 high 2609.02) that were fully retraced.", "Overhead structure crowds the setup versus its invalidation: 2747.76 is only 5.20 above the prior M15 range high 2742.56 and only 23.24 below the 2771 D1 spike high, against a 29.67-point stop distance.", "Bar 119 is a weak breakout bar, not a bull trend bar closing on its high: its close 2734.92 sits in the lower ~19% of its 2731.83-2747.76 range with a 12.84 upper tail.", "The 21-bar M15 range is only about 45 points (1.6%) and oscillates around the H4 breakout bar's close 2723.15 - consistent with balance at the breakout level, and tight-range breakouts frequently fail without a strong breakout bar."], "qualitative_confidence": "medium", "uncertainty": ["Whether the M15 tight range resolves upward or becomes a final flag: no bar in the supplied packet closes above 2747.76, so the breakout is untriggered and unconfirmed.", "The would-be signal bar is already printed (bar 119) and is marginal (new high by 5.20 with a 12.84 upper tail); a stronger bull bar closing on its high would raise confidence in the same trigger.", "The D1 context is 15 hours older than the frozen decision time and its 2771/2557 levels are contextual descriptions; the D1 spike high 2771 was exceeded only by a wick (M15 bar 98 high 2850) with no close above it."], "conditions_that_change_market_read": ["A M15 close back below 2731.83 (bar 119 low) and then below 2718.09 (bar 117 low) would mark a failed breakout of the range high and void the long case.", "A M15/H1 close below 2702.56 (bar 98 low) would break the three-hour acceptance above the H4 2700 zone and return price to the prior H4 wide range.", "Repeated M15 closes between 2718.09 and 2747.76 without exceeding 2747.76 would keep the tight-range read and argue against a breakout.", "A M15 close above 2747.76 with the low holding above 2731.83 would confirm the breakout and shift the focus to 2771 and then 2850."]}, "latest_market_context": {"schema": "brooks.market-context.v1", "role": "HTF_ANALYST", "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "decision_time_ms": 1790035199999, "timeframe": "D1", "observations": ["The window opens at 2109.85 (close of 1779667200000) after a 2139.34 high, then declines 13 bars to 1368.42 (low of 1780704000000), about 36% below 2139.34.", "Bar 1780704000000 has a 230.85 range with a 200.13 lower tail and closes at 1568.55 (top ~13% of its range); bar 1780790400000 (open 1568.55, high 1690.78, low 1563.52, close 1687.83) is a bull reversal bar closing at its high.", "From 1780790400000 to 1787011200000 (73 bars) price overlaps repeatedly between 1512.91 (low of 1782432000000) and 1974.46 (high of 1785110400000); closes cluster 1550-1950 with many overlapping bodies and mixed closes (two-sided range).", "Bar 1787097600000 breaks out: open 1916.51, high 2293.80, low 1905.63, close 2252.16, a 388.17-point bull trend bar closing in the top ~11% of its range and above the 1974.46 range top.", "Bar 1787270400000 spikes to 2771 with a 445.69 range, closing 2515.30 and leaving a ~255.70 upper tail.", "Bars 1787184000000 through 1789603200000 (27 bars) stay between 2357.18 (low of 1788307200000) and 2680 (high of 1789084800000); bodies overlap and closes sit mostly 2380-2530.", "The last four closes are 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.90, 2775.61; the final bar (open 2642.90, high 2850, low 2641.70, close 2775.61) closes above the prior spike high 2771 in the upper 64% of its 208.30-point range."], "evidence_against": ["The strongest counterargument: the largest single directional move in the window is the opening 12-bar, ~36% bear leg to 1368.42, so the bull-trend label rests only on the last ~34 bars, and the 73 bars before that are balance, not trend.", "The 27 bars ahead of the final push are a two-sided range (2357.18-2680) with heavy overlap and mid-range closes; 2850 is a first-bar probe only 79.00 above 2771, and single-bar breakouts of multi-week range tops often fail and re-enter the range.", "Bar 1787270400000 (445.69 range, close 2515.30, ~255.70 upper tail) followed by a 27-bar stall is spike-high behavior consistent with a temporary exhaustion and a market capped by a range boundary rather than a functioning bull channel.", "The 208.30-point final bar after an extended advance could be a buy climax; a large bull bar that is immediately retraced would mark exhaustion rather than breakout acceptance."], "uncertainty": ["V2 D1 context adapted for the V1 PM input."]}, "management_history": [{"schema": "brooks.management-decision.v2", "role": "POSITION_MANAGER", "decision_time_ms": 1790069400000, "action": "HOLD", "position_ids": ["wf-main-1"], "reason": "State reconciles and no policy-admissible de-risking action is available. One MAIN LONG 0.159 ETH-USDT (wf-main-1) matches its single FILLED entry at 2749.714944 and its live quantity at mark 2738.65; hedge_state is single_main with main_position_id wf-main-1, main_side LONG, main_size 0.159, hedge_position_id null, hedge_size 0, hedge_ratio 0, net_exposure_usd equal to gross_exposure_usd 435.44535 and unresolved false; open_orders and fills_since_last_event are empty; margin_health is SAFE (equity 9998.065792, available margin 9910.976722 USDT). The opted-in long exit experiment applies because applicable_risk_behavior.long_exit_policy is exactly lock_and_wait_nonnegative_net and operation_correlation_id ETH-USDT-1h-1790002799999 exactly matches the snapshot correlation_id, with no conflicting risk-behavior field. The deterministic 5R lock has not fired: policy_state.projected_exit_net is -2.151